7. DATA HANDLING
────────────────
This software processes DICOM medical images locally on the hospital's
computer. When cloud sync is enabled, images are transmitted to the configured
Ozzyl HMS cloud endpoint via encrypted HTTPS. The User is responsible for:
  a) Ensuring compliance with local data protection and patient privacy laws.
  b) Configuring appropriate security settings on their network.
  c) Maintaining the confidentiality of API keys and credentials.

